{"id":3410,"slug":"3410-virtual-scrolling-trong-vue-xu-ly-large-lists-hieu-qua","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Performance","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Virtual scrolling trong Vue — xử lý large lists hiệu quả?","question_en":"Virtual scrolling in Vue — efficiently handling large lists?","answer_vi":"Render hàng nghìn DOM nodes cùng lúc rất chậm. Virtual scrolling chỉ render visible items:\n\n**Vue Virtual Scroller** (`@vueuse/components` hoặc `vue-virtual-scroller`):\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { useVirtualList } from '@vueuse/core'\n\nconst items = ref(Array.from({ length: 10000 }, (_, i) => ({ id: i, name: `Item ${i}` })))\n\nconst { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(items, {\n  itemHeight: 40,  // Fixed height per item (required)\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <!-- Container với overflow scroll -->\n  <div v-bind=\"containerProps\" style=\"height: 600px; overflow-y: auto\">\n    <!-- Wrapper với total height để scroll bar đúng -->\n    <div v-bind=\"wrapperProps\">\n      <!-- Chỉ visible items được render -->\n      <div\n        v-for=\"{ data: item } in list\"\n        :key=\"item.id\"\n        style=\"height: 40px\"\n      >\n        {{ item.name }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\nVới variable-height items, dùng `vue-virtual-scroller`'s `DynamicScroller`. Kết hợp với `v-memo` cho items có nhiều reactive dependencies","answer_en":"Virtual scrolling renders only visible items, not the entire list.\n\n**Using `@vueuse/core`'s `useVirtualList`**:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nconst items = ref(/* 10000 items */)\nconst { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(items, { itemHeight: 40 })\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div v-bind=\"containerProps\" style=\"height: 600px; overflow-y: auto\">\n    <div v-bind=\"wrapperProps\">\n      <div v-for=\"{ data: item } in list\" :key=\"item.id\" style=\"height: 40px\">\n        {{ item.name }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\nFor variable-height items use `vue-virtual-scroller`'s `DynamicScroller`. Combine with `v-memo` for items with many reactive dependencies.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Render hàng nghìn DOM nodes cùng lúc rất chậm. Virtual scrolling chỉ render visible items:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Vue Virtual Scroller</strong> (<code>@vueuse/components</code> hoặc <code>vue-virtual-scroller</code>):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nimport { useVirtualList } from '@vueuse/core'\n\nconst items = ref(Array.from({ length: 10000 }, (_, i) =&gt; ({ id: i, name: `Item ${i}` })))\n\nconst { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(items, {\n  itemHeight: 40,  // Fixed height per item (required)\n})\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;!-- Container với overflow scroll --&gt;\n  &lt;div v-bind=&quot;containerProps&quot; style=&quot;height: 600px; overflow-y: auto&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;!-- Wrapper với total height để scroll bar đúng --&gt;\n    &lt;div v-bind=&quot;wrapperProps&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;!-- Chỉ visible items được render --&gt;\n      &lt;div\n        v-for=&quot;{ data: item } in list&quot;\n        :key=&quot;item.id&quot;\n        style=&quot;height: 40px&quot;\n      &gt;\n        {{ item.name }}\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { useVirtualList } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@vueuse/core&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> items = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">from</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">length</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10000</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">_, i</span>) =&gt;</span> ({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: i, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">`Item <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${i}</span>`</span> })))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useVirtualList</span>(items, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">itemHeight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">40</span>,  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Fixed height per item (required)</span>\n})\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Container với overflow scroll --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-bind</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;containerProps&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;height: 600px; overflow-y: auto&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Wrapper với total height để scroll bar đúng --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-bind</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;wrapperProps&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Chỉ visible items được render --&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;{ data: item } in list&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item.id&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;height: 40px&quot;</span>\n      &gt;</span>\n        {{ item.name }}\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Với variable-height items, dùng <code>vue-virtual-scroller</code>'s <code>DynamicScroller</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Kết hợp với <code>v-memo</code> cho items có nhiều reactive dependencies.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Virtual scrolling renders only visible items, not the entire list.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Using <code>@vueuse/core</code>'s <code>useVirtualList</code></strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nconst items = ref(/* 10000 items */)\nconst { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = useVirtualList(items, { itemHeight: 40 })\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;div v-bind=&quot;containerProps&quot; style=&quot;height: 600px; overflow-y: auto&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div v-bind=&quot;wrapperProps&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div v-for=&quot;{ data: item } in list&quot; :key=&quot;item.id&quot; style=&quot;height: 40px&quot;&gt;\n        {{ item.name }}\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> items = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* 10000 items */</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { list, containerProps, wrapperProps } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useVirtualList</span>(items, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">itemHeight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">40</span> })\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-bind</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;containerProps&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;height: 600px; overflow-y: auto&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-bind</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;wrapperProps&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;{ data: item } in list&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:key</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item.id&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;height: 40px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n        {{ item.name }}\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">For variable-height items use <code>vue-virtual-scroller</code>'s <code>DynamicScroller</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Combine with <code>v-memo</code> for items with many reactive dependencies.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"},{"url":"/q/3206-v-if-vs-v-show-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"v-if vs v-show — khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/3207-tai-sao-key-trong-v-for-quan-trong","title":"Tại sao `:key` trong `v-for` quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/3208-v-model-hoat-dong-the-nao-custom-v-model","title":"v-model hoạt động thế nào? Custom v-model?"}]}